(66, 'What is Asthprash (300 grams)?', 'Asthprash is a herbal lung support formula made with Ayurvedic goodness designed to help you breathe better and stay protected from everyday pollution.', 'general_info', 1, 'Dayjoy_Product_Brochure_English_July2026.pdf'),
(66, 'Who should use Asthprash?', 'It is suitable for all age groups looking to protect their respiratory system from pollution or seeking relief from shortness of breath, asthma, or allergies. According to the recommendation chart, it may help with running nose, headache, fever, cough, and sinusitis.', 'usage', 2, 'recommendation_chart_clean.csv'),
(66, 'Who should avoid it or are there contraindications?', 'Information not available in source documents; requires verification from Dayjoy QA/regulatory team.', 'safety', 3, NULL),
(66, 'What are the key benefits of Asthprash?', 'It helps clean lungs from poisonous tar and air pollution, controls asthma and allergy problems, strengthens lung tissue, improves respiratory performance, and boosts immunity.', 'benefits', 4, 'Dayjoy_Product_Brochure_English_July2026.pdf'),
(66, 'What are the ingredients in Asthprash?', 'The powerful herbal ingredients include Tulsi, Mulethi (Licorice), Kali Mirch (Black Pepper), Adusa (Vasa Patra), and Honey.', 'ingredients', 5, 'Dayjoy_Product_Brochure_English_July2026.pdf'),
(66, 'What is the recommended dosage for Asthprash?', 'For adults: Take 1 tablespoon (15-20 g) before sleeping. For children: Take 1/2 tablespoon in the morning, or as directed by a physician.', 'dosage', 6, 'Dayjoy_Product_Brochure_English_July2026.pdf'),
(66, 'What are the warnings or side effects?', 'Information not available in source documents; requires verification from Dayjoy QA/regulatory team.', 'safety', 7, NULL),
(66, 'How should Asthprash be stored?', 'Information not available in source documents; requires verification from Dayjoy QA/regulatory team.', 'storage', 8, NULL),
(66, 'What is the shelf life / expiry?', 'Information not available in source documents; requires verification from Dayjoy QA/regulatory team.', 'shelf_life', 9, NULL),
(66, 'How does it compare to other respiratory products like N-Astheal?', 'While both support respiratory health, Asthprash is a paste/jam containing honey and Tulsi for daily lung protection against tar, whereas N-Astheal is a tablet specifically for managing bronchial congestion.', 'comparison', 10, 'Dayjoy_Product_Brochure_English_July2026.pdf'),
(66, 'What is the price, DP, and BV for distributors?', 'The MRP is ₹2999, DP is ₹1499, and BV is 720.', 'pricing', 11, 'India-BV-Price-May-2026.pdf'),
(66, 'Is it suitable for a specific age group?', 'Yes, it is explicitly mentioned as suitable for all age groups. It has specific dosages for children and adults.', 'target_audience', 12, 'Dayjoy_Product_Brochure_English_July2026.pdf'),
(66, 'Does Asthprash cure asthma or pneumonia?', 'This product does not replace medical treatment. Consult a qualified physician before use, especially if you are on medication or have a diagnosed condition. It only supports lung tissue and is ''useful in treating'' as an Ayurvedic supplement.', 'safety', 13, 'Dayjoy_Product_Brochure_English_July2026.pdf'),
(67, 'Who should avoid it / contraindications?', 'Information not available in source documents; requires verification from Dayjoy QA/regulatory team.', 'safety', 1, NULL),
