(67, 'What are the ingredients?', 'Powerful herbal ingredients include Ashok, Satavari, Lodhra, Guduchi, Punarnava, and Ashvagandha.', 'ingredients', 3, 'Dayjoy_Product_Brochure_English_July2026.pdf'),
(67, 'What is the recommended dosage?', 'Take 1-2 tablets twice daily after a meal, or as directed by the physician.', 'dosage', 4, 'Dayjoy_Product_Brochure_English_July2026.pdf'),
